  "body": "**Blocked by:** #189, #176\n\n## Context\n\nThis issue builds on #189; #191 is the next sequential slice of the `deployment` batch.\n\n## Task\n\nAdd deploy.sh <tag>: validate tag; checkout into /opt/semprec/releases/<tag>; frozen install/build; forward migrations; atomic current symlink swap; restart API, agents, every active mailsync, transcribe, gateway. Abort before swap on failure. Read only shared .env and never copy secrets.\n\n## Scope\n\n### In scope\n\n- Task deliverables, migrations, integration, tests, and necessary documentation.\n\n### Out of scope\n\n- No git pull/manual production edits or auto deploy.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- Successful deploy reports one version across processes.\n- Preactivation failure leaves current/services unchanged.\n- current never targets partial build.\n- All process types restart and shared secrets persist.\n",
